01:16:59.315 --> 01:17:00.715
Hey, man.


01:17:05.254 --> 01:17:06.754
You leavin' already?


01:17:09.158 --> 01:17:10.791
Yeah. Uh...


01:17:13.129 --> 01:17:14.829
